OL,3,GNEWSAArtist wins tattoo show award with
OL,4,Amystery design
OL,5,
OL,6,FWould you blindly get a tattoo without
OL,7,Fseeing the design first?
OL,9,FThat is what Bibek Raut did at the Big
OL,10,FLondon Tattoo Show, where he did not
OL,11,Fsee his new piece of body art until the
OL,12,Fneedle broke the skin.
OL,14,FHis trust paid off - the thigh tattoo
OL,15,Fwon Best of Friday, one of two awards
OL,16,Fcollected by Abhishek Shakya at the
OL,17,Fevent held over the beginning of
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
